      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000018",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Paddling is an outdoor adventure activity that takes place on moving and open water, in changing weather. Some risks remain however carefully the activity is run, and they are part of what makes it exciting. They include:",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000020",
        "type": "bullet_list",
        "items": [
          "capsizing, falling in, and being trapped under or against a boat;",
          "cold water, which can cause sudden gasping, loss of strength and, over time, hypothermia;",
          "currents, tides, waves, wind and weather that change quickly and can carry you away from where you meant to go;",
          "collision with other boats, swimmers, rocks, bridges, banks and objects under the water;",
          "slips, trips and falls while launching, landing or carrying boats;",
          "strains, sprains, blisters, sunburn and dehydration;",
          "illness caught from water, such as stomach upsets, and contact with wildlife and plants; and",
          "rescue or medical help taking longer to reach you than it would on land."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000021",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "These risks can cause injury, illness, damage to or loss of your belongings and, in rare cases, death.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000022",
        "type": "numbered_list",
        "items": [
          "We give every participant a safety briefing before the activity starts, covering how to use the equipment, what to do if you capsize, and the area you may use.",
          "We provide equipment that is suitable for the activity and checked before use, including a buoyancy aid for every participant.",
          "We check the weather and water conditions on the day, and we will change, delay or cancel the activity if we judge it unsafe. Our guides may also end the activity early at any time for safety reasons.",
          "On guided paddles and lessons, our guides hold recognised paddlesport qualifications and carry safety and first aid equipment."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000024",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "You agree to:",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000026",
        "type": "numbered_list",
        "items": [
          "listen to the safety briefing and follow every instruction our staff give you, before and during the activity;",
          "wear your buoyancy aid, fastened correctly, at all times on or near the water, and a helmet when we ask you to;",
          "stay within the area and times we set for a hire, and return at the time agreed;",
          "not take part under the influence of alcohol or drugs, or when you are too tired or unwell to paddle safely;",
          "tell us before the activity about anything that could affect your safety or the safety of others, and tell your guide straight away if you feel unwell or unsure during it;",
          "look after the equipment and return it in the condition you received it, apart from fair wear and tear; and",
          "respect other water users, wildlife, landowners and the local rules of the waterway."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000027",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "We may refuse to let you take part, or stop you taking part, if we reasonably believe you are putting yourself or others at risk. When this happens because you have not followed these rules, you may not be entitled to a refund.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000028",
        "type": "dropdown_field",
        "fieldKey": "how_confident_are_you_in_the_water",
        "label": "How confident are you in the water?",
        "required": true,
        "helpText": "Non-swimmers can take part in some activities, with a guide close by.",
        "placeholder": null,
        "options": [
          "I can swim confidently",
          "I can swim a little",
          "I cannot swim"
        ],
        "display": "radios"
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000030",
        "type": "dropdown_field",
        "fieldKey": "have_you_paddled_a_kayak_or_canoe_before",
        "label": "Have you paddled a kayak or canoe before?",
        "required": true,
        "helpText": null,
        "placeholder": null,
        "options": [
          "Never",
          "A few times",
          "Regularly"
        ],
        "display": "radios"
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000031",
        "type": "dropdown_field",
        "fieldKey": "is_there_anything_about_your_fitness_that_could_affect_your",
        "label": "Is there anything about your fitness that could affect your safety on the water?",
        "required": true,
        "helpText": "For example a condition that could cause you to faint or have a seizure, a recent injury, or anything that affects your breathing.",
        "placeholder": null,
        "options": [
          "Yes",
          "No"
        ],
        "display": "radios",
        "across": true
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000032",
        "type": "text_field",
        "fieldKey": "what_should_your_guide_know",
        "label": "What should your guide know?",
        "required": true,
        "helpText": "We use this only to plan the activity safely and to tell emergency services if you need help.",
        "visibleWhen": {
          "sourceBlockId": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000031",
          "operator": "equals",
          "value": "Yes"
        },
        "placeholder": null,
        "multiline": true,
        "boxHeight": 45
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000033",
        "type": "numbered_list",
        "items": [
          "You take part in the activity voluntarily. You confirm that you have read and understood the risks described above, and that you accept them.",
          "As far as the law allows, you release us from liability for any loss, damage, injury or illness that you suffer as a result of the risks that are part of the activity, where we have not been negligent and have not broken this agreement.",
          "You are responsible for loss of or damage to the equipment caused by your carelessness or by not following our instructions, apart from fair wear and tear.",
          "Nothing in this document limits or excludes our liability for death or personal injury caused by our negligence, for fraud, or for anything else that cannot be limited or excluded by law. It does not take away any rights you have by law."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000035",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "Our guides sometimes take photographs during the activity to share with participants and to show on our website and social media. We will only use photographs in which you can be recognised for publicity if you agree below. You can change your mind at any time by telling us.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000037",
        "type": "checkbox_field",
        "fieldKey": "i_agree_that_photographs_in_which_i_can_be_recognised_may_be",
        "label": "I agree that photographs in which I can be recognised may be used on your website and social media",
        "required": false,
        "helpText": null,
        "checkedByDefault": false
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000038",
        "type": "dropdown_field",
        "fieldKey": "is_the_participant_under_18",
        "label": "Is the participant under 18?",
        "required": true,
        "helpText": null,
        "placeholder": null,
        "options": [
          "Yes",
          "No"
        ],
        "display": "radios",
        "across": true
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000040",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "text": "A parent or guardian must sign for any participant under 18. By signing, the parent or guardian confirms that they have read this document, that they agree to it on the young person's behalf, and that the young person understands and will follow the rules above.",
        "alignment": "left"
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000041",
        "type": "text_field",
        "fieldKey": "parent_or_guardian_name",
        "label": "Parent or guardian name",
        "required": true,
        "helpText": null,
        "visibleWhen": {
          "sourceBlockId": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000038",
          "operator": "equals",
          "value": "Yes"
        },
        "placeholder": null,
        "multiline": false
      },
      {
        "id": "d6010000-0000-4000-8000-000000000042",
        "type": "text_field",
        "fieldKey": "relationship_to_the_participant",
